      "id": "claim_c38a7b6b20f646c6bf26bc7676334492",
      "statement": "The CRC32C checksum is computed over the concatenation of tx_seq (little-endian, 8 bytes), payload_len (little-endian, 4 bytes), and the payload bytes.",
