      "statement": "Possible JournalError variants include: BadMagic (header magic mismatch), RegionTooSmall (journal region insufficient), TransactionTooLarge (single transaction exceeds ring capacity), CorruptFrame (CRC/validation failure), and BlockOutOfRange (metadata op targets out-of-range block).",
